OL,3,GNEWSAHuntingdon train attacker found
OL,4,Aguilty of all 14 counts of attempted
OL,5,Amurder
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthony Williams has been found guilty
OL,8,Fof 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,10,FWilliams, 33, stabbed 10 people on an
OL,11,FLNER train to London as it passed
OL,12,Fthrough Cambridgeshire on 1 November
OL,13,Flast year
OL,15,FWilliams was also found guilty of four
OL,16,Fcounts of attempted murder away from
OL,17,Fthe train, in Peterborough and London
OL,19,FThe jury initially found him guilty of
OL,20,Fseven counts, but hadn't reached
OL,21,Fverdicts on the remaining seven
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
